						700090702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 700090702,
					"content": "#唔…窝要站在椅子上…{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_CUTEBIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_CUTEBIGSISTER]}，帮我搬一把椅子过来吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						700090703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莉莉"
				},
				{
					"id": 700090703,
					"content": "#做好啦！窝可做了三份喔，{PLAYERAVATAR#SEXPRO[INFO_MALE_PRONOUN_CUTEBIGBROTHER|INFO_FEMALE_PRONOUN_CUTEBIGSISTER]}你一份，我一份…还有那个驴人众的蜀黍一份！",
